  "worked_solution": "We multiply the numerators and the denominators as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{w}^{3}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{5}{3z}=\\frac{{w}^{3}\\cdot 5}{2\\cdot 3z}=\\frac{5{w}^{3}}{6z}\n$$",
